      <h2>What are ChatGPT & Gemini AI photo editing prompts?</h2>
      <p>AI photo editing prompts are short written instructions that you paste into ChatGPT or Google Gemini together with a photo you upload. A strong prompt for photo editing names the change you want, such as the lighting, the background, the style or the crop, and then names what must stay the same: usually the face, the pose and the clothes. That second half is the part most people forget, and it is the difference between a polished edit and a result that no longer looks like you.</p>
      <p>promptbeen collects tested ChatGPT and Gemini prompts in one place, so you do not have to dig through screenshots, captions and comment threads. Every card has a Copy Prompt button, and the free <a href="/ai-photo-prompt-tool/">prompt tool</a> lets you generate, modify, edit and correct your own wording.</p>

      <h2>Gemini AI photo prompt copy paste (Portraits, Couples & Groups)</h2>
      <p>Looking for a reliable <strong>gemini ai photo prompt copy paste</strong>? Google Gemini's image editing capabilities excel when provided with explicit photographic context. A high-performing <strong>gemini ai prompt copy paste</strong> specifies camera perspective, ambient lighting, lens characteristics, and strict identity preservation. Every prompt card in our library is engineered to function as a Gemini AI photo prompt copy paste—just copy the text, attach your picture in Gemini, and generate stunning portraits, couple shots, or group scenes without facial distortion.</p>

      <h2>Couple prompt for Gemini AI & romantic couple AI prompts</h2>
      <p>Capturing the intimacy and chemistry of two people requires a specialized <strong>couple prompt for Gemini AI</strong>. Generic AI edits frequently blend two faces together or morph facial features. Our <strong>gemini ai couple photo prompt copy paste</strong> templates and <strong>romantic couple ai prompts</strong> enforce a dual-identity lock, instructing the model to "keep both faces, hairstyles, and outfits unchanged". Whether you need a <strong>couple romantic prompt for gemini ai</strong> featuring golden hour beach sunsets, a misty rainy city scene, or an editorial <strong>gemini prompt couple</strong> studio shot, our <strong>couple photo prompt</strong> library ensures both people remain natural and recognizable.</p>

      <h2>Family photo prompts: group edits that keep faces consistent</h2>
      <p>Editing group pictures is challenging because AI models often scramble multiple faces or alter ages. Our curated <strong>family photo prompts</strong> provide structured multi-person instructions. By using these <strong>family photo prompts</strong>, you can place your family in a sunlit botanical garden, a cozy holiday living room, or a clean studio setting while keeping every family member's smile, facial structure, age, and clothing authentic.</p>

      <h2>New trending prompt styles for Instagram creators</h2>
      <p>Instagram aesthetics move fast. As soon as a fresh visual trend takes off—from 3D miniature dioramas and collectible figures to 90s disposable camera film grain—we release a <strong>new trending prompt</strong> optimized for both Gemini and ChatGPT. By copying a verified <strong>trending prompt</strong> from promptbeen, you get the exact aesthetic grading and lighting formula without wasting time on guesswork. Check our guide on <a href="/blog/trending-instagram-chatgpt-photo-editing-prompts/">how trending prompts work</a> for the full breakdown.</p>

      <h2>ChatGPT photo editing prompts text: add words without hiding faces</h2>
      <p>Words on photos are one of the most requested edits. ChatGPT photo editing prompts text works best when you give the exact wording, a lettering style and a position. For example: headline in bold sans-serif at the top, small subtitle at the bottom, face never covered. Keep phrases short and check every letter, because long sentences are where spelling mistakes appear. Start with the magazine cover, quote overlay and birthday card prompts, which already use text blocks you can edit in seconds.</p>

      <h2>Prompt seen ChatGPT users share online? Find it and rebuild it</h2>
      <p>Many visitors arrive after searching for a prompt seen ChatGPT creators mention in a Reel, a Story or a comment. Captions often cut the prompt off, or the creator only shows the result. The fastest fix is to search the library by style, copy the closest match, and then use the <a href="/ai-photo-prompt-tool/#fix">corrector</a> and <a href="/ai-photo-prompt-tool/#mod">modifier</a> to rebuild the missing pieces. If the prompt seen ChatGPT edit used a trending look, the Trending Instagram filter is the quickest place to start. For a full walkthrough, read <a href="/blog/prompt-seen-chatgpt-how-to-find-and-rebuild-it/">how to find and rebuild a prompt seen ChatGPT creators use</a>.</p>
